commit 6d75afa4a3e623623fef70bd1df84defb5469581

C03: a request for free content is produced directly, not turned into a question (KNOWLEDGE1353)

KNOWLEDGE998/1144/1149/1179 left the free-content literals open: «contame un chiste» asked for the language or the kind of joke, «estoy aburrido» asked instead of proposing. A free_content presentation shape (joke, curiosity, something interesting, «estoy aburrido») hands the model the request as data and demands the content itself: no question, no menu of kinds, topics or languages, no invented personal experiences.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


